                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game is awesome! It has great graphics, mechanics, and details. But something that would really be a cool addition to the game is better animations, they just feel kinda off when I am shooting and running. An another nice addiction would be choosing my own load out before launching into the round, like in the lobby we could choose the maximum ammo and what gun to start with, kinda like phasmophobia. (PLEASE PLEASE ADD A NEW MAP, LIKE FLORIDA WITH ENDLESS RAINS AND CROCODILES/ALLIGATORS). Also just sometimes the game would lag for everybody, my friends and randoms too. There is just some sort of thing that makes everyone's FPS drop down.\n\nThis game is a very fun expirience, I got fucking deafened from a lightning strike. 10/10 ripped eardrums.\n\nThis is where happened, the female bigfoot twurled out of the bushes and started ripping clothes off me. And she starts giving me a knobber. I blew my load in the sasquatch, and she got up and ripped the tree down. And then she starts blowing me again. And little did you know I busted nutt again, and she is like \"mmm, mmm that good\". And now I dont know what I should do? Do I call the police and say I got raped by a bigfoot?",
